00:00:39.228 --> 00:00:42.305
- [Voiceover] Brian asks,
"Should I post articles

00:00:42.305 --> 00:00:44.104
"on my blog and mention on social

00:00:44.104 --> 00:00:45.599
"or post natively on sites

00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:49.108
"like Linkedin, Medium,
and Facebook, or both?"

00:00:49.961 --> 00:00:52.341
- Brian, great question,
and it's a loaded question,

00:00:52.341 --> 00:00:53.606
because you've probably looked at

00:00:53.606 --> 00:00:55.032
the new garyvaynerchuk.com

00:00:55.032 --> 00:00:55.902
(ding)

00:00:55.902 --> 00:00:59.084
and you probably realized
that I'm doing a mix.

00:00:59.084 --> 00:01:00.848
Like, you know, you land on a page

00:01:00.848 --> 00:01:03.330
and I've got the place for
Medium posts and Linkedin posts.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.935
When you land on it, some of the posts

00:01:04.935 --> 00:01:07.280
literally link out to Linkedin and Medium,

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.871
and then obviously I have my own posts,

00:01:08.871 --> 00:01:10.345
and actually, Steve and
I were just talking.

00:01:10.345 --> 00:01:11.477
Did we put up the first post where it's

00:01:11.477 --> 00:01:13.195
just for garyvaynerchuk.com?

00:01:13.195 --> 00:01:13.846
- [Steve] Yes, we did.

00:01:13.846 --> 00:01:14.392
- Got it.

00:01:14.392 --> 00:01:15.413
So that's there too.

00:01:15.413 --> 00:01:18.037
And so what I think is
interesting about this question

00:01:18.037 --> 00:01:21.075
is most people in the
internet marketing world

00:01:21.075 --> 00:01:23.247
want to keep telling you
to do it on your own site,

00:01:23.247 --> 00:01:25.255
monetize your own traffic, it's yours,

00:01:25.255 --> 00:01:28.562
Facebook reach can't be taken away.

00:01:28.562 --> 00:01:30.720
All this "own it, own it, own it."

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:32.601
The problem with "own it, own it, own it"

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:34.806
is when you're doing it on your own site,

00:01:34.806 --> 00:01:36.758
you're at the mercy of how much traffic

00:01:36.758 --> 00:01:39.300
you're able to establish on your own site,

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:42.771
and so from the 99.999% of
you that are watching this

00:01:42.771 --> 00:01:45.070
that don't have four million unique people

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:47.682
coming to your site
every day, every month,

00:01:47.682 --> 00:01:49.900
the reality is is placed like Medium,

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:52.916
for example, I had a
Medium go extremely viral,

00:01:54.531 --> 00:01:57.101
viral as in it did really well on Medium,

00:01:57.101 --> 00:01:59.224
and right now it's sitting
as number six or seven

00:01:59.224 --> 00:02:02.674
on Medium's top stories where I've noticed

00:02:02.674 --> 00:02:06.109
that 950 people have clicked
over and read the article

00:02:06.109 --> 00:02:08.781
because of that place,
and that's 950 people

00:02:08.781 --> 00:02:11.602
that I'm gonna guess 787 of them

00:02:11.602 --> 00:02:13.576
have never even heard of me before.

00:02:13.576 --> 00:02:15.410
And so too many people are worried about

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:18.487
monetizing the now, posting on their page,

00:02:18.487 --> 00:02:20.902
versus using things like
Linkedin and Medium,

00:02:20.902 --> 00:02:23.560
and notice I use those two
because they have viral loops.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.998
Linkedin, when articles go
well, it shows up in Pulse.

00:02:25.998 --> 00:02:29.145
Medium sends out an email
and has the top stories.

00:02:29.145 --> 00:02:31.722
So I like being in places
where there's viral loops,

00:02:31.722 --> 00:02:33.278
that if you put out a
nice piece of content,

00:02:33.278 --> 00:02:36.262
I noticed the kid on
Twitter today tweet out,

00:02:36.262 --> 00:02:37.585
"Hey, I'm number four on Medium,

00:02:37.585 --> 00:02:39.512
"two spots ahead of Gary V,"

00:02:39.512 --> 00:02:40.569
and then I looked at his profile

00:02:40.569 --> 00:02:43.019
and he has 1,400 Twitter followers,

00:02:43.019 --> 00:02:44.121
and that got me excited, I'm like

00:02:44.121 --> 00:02:47.070
"See, great content can raise to the top

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:48.673
and bring awareness,"

00:02:48.673 --> 00:02:52.202
and so I think a heavy mix of both.

00:02:52.202 --> 00:02:54.779
I'm a big fan of picking
spots strategically

00:02:54.779 --> 00:02:58.027
that give you awareness and
then builds leverage for you

00:02:58.027 --> 00:03:00.993
that then eventually you can
monetize in your own world.

