like, you guys, the community.

00:03:37.034 --> 00:03:39.193
I have a lot of nurturing DNA.

00:03:39.193 --> 00:03:41.492
I'm a motherly kind of character.

00:03:41.492 --> 00:03:43.698
I also have an 11 year younger brother

00:03:43.698 --> 00:03:46.356
that gave me a test run into fatherhood,

00:03:46.356 --> 00:03:48.818
because my brother and I have
that kind of relationship,

00:03:48.818 --> 00:03:51.348
especially cause my dad
is such a workaholic,

00:03:51.348 --> 00:03:52.417
wasn't around as much.

00:03:52.417 --> 00:03:53.520
