00:04:10.704 --> 00:04:12.794
A brother, even as much as I love AJ,

00:04:12.794 --> 00:04:14.106
it's a different feeling from children.

00:04:14.106 --> 00:04:17.767
I think the thing that it's taught me is,

00:04:19.803 --> 00:04:22.067
I want to say unconditional
love, but the truth is

00:04:22.067 --> 00:04:23.949
I probably love my parents and siblings

00:04:23.949 --> 00:04:25.655
more than the average person

00:04:25.655 --> 00:04:27.788
from what I've been able to gather.

00:04:30.253 --> 00:04:32.174
It's taught me things I knew, which is

00:04:32.174 --> 00:04:34.670
the fear that I have for any,

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.410
Misha, yesterday, talking to me about

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:41.091
